    wrapper='# Cooking source and exact manuscript review\n\nActual notebook: [Calibration Review](https://chatgpt.com/g/g-p-67f17555a8dc8191a2b5b81e6d8adc12-dungeon-crawler/c/6a7a0fa2-eee0-83ea-92e9-6723a9f67ede). Source conference `d4ee39f9-b5b9-41b7-87bd-4fc4d09e843f`, reply `2988d5a5-60a9-4142-b0be-a9f42a809ca0`; exact review `'+TURN+'`, reply `'+REPLY+'`. Both [source conference](GPT_COOKING_SOURCE_CONFERENCE.txt) and [exact review](GPT_COOKING_EXACT_REVIEW.txt) are preserved.\n\nGPT approved the entire 44-card set after five finite repairs, all applied:\n\n'+''.join('- '+s+'\n' for s in repairs['repairs'])+'\nThe conservative food-credit classification, atomic feast replacement, independent temporary HP, source durations, RP without a new rest cap, contaminated-skewer profile and predeclared donor traits are explicitly approved. There are 30 public, two restricted and 12 Director-only formulas. All 30 public effects match exact V5 book paragraphs. 45 checks pass; 24 protected source/prior-rule files remain unchanged. The [final manifest](../../../../DescentReviewChanges/ReviewBible/docs/mechanics/COOKING_REVIEW_STATUS.json) pins all five reviewed artifacts.\n\nThis closes Cooking authored operational effect review only. Ingredient availability, numerical balance, expedition food/Supply conversion, generated bestiary corrections, runtime/companion parity, human playtesting, whole-game flow and delivery remain open. No source deletion or GitHub push; cosmology remains post-push only.\n'
    (AUDIT/'GPT_COOKING_EXACT_REVIEW.md').write_text(wrapper,encoding='utf-8')
    f=AUDIT/'COOKING_EXACT_SUBMISSION.json';x=read(f);assert (AUDIT/'CODEX_COOKING_EXACT_REVIEW.txt').read_text(encoding='utf-8').strip()==(AUDIT/'CODEX_COOKING_EXACT_REVIEW_SENT.txt').read_text(encoding='utf-8').strip();x.update(status='completed; five exact repairs applied',exactReviewTurnId=TURN,exactReplyId=REPLY,validationChecks=45,reviewStatus=str(manifest.relative_to(GAME)));dump(f,x)
    f=AUDIT/'COOKING_SOURCE_CONFERENCE_STATUS.json';x=read(f);x.update(exactReviewCompleted=True,exactReviewTurnId=TURN,exactReplyId=REPLY,finalReviewManifest=str(manifest.relative_to(GAME)));dump(f,x)
    f=AUDIT/'COOKING_NUTRITION_ACCOUNTING.json';x=read(f);x['status']='reviewed conservative source nutrition accounting; approved by exact Cooking review';dump(f,x)
    coverage=ROOT/'data/playtest/game_development_coverage.json';backup(coverage,'COVERAGE_BEFORE_COOKING_COMPLETION.json');cv=read(coverage)
