    anchor='| Ordinary spells |';assert anchor in s;s=s.replace(anchor,'| [Cooking recipes](DescentReviewChanges/ReviewBible/docs/mechanics/COOKING_PUBLIC_RECIPE_CARDS.md) | All 44 formulas jointly reviewed; 30 public, 14 separately gated; 45 checks pass | Ingredient/donor availability, food/Supply integration, runtime and balance |\n'+anchor,1)
    old='The latest recipe work completes [all 45 Herbalism formulas](DescentReviewChanges/ReviewBible/docs/mechanics/HERBALISM_RECIPE_PLAYTEST.md), including [29 public cards](DescentReviewChanges/ReviewBible/docs/mechanics/HERBALISM_PUBLIC_RECIPE_CARDS.md). GPT’s four exact repairs are applied; 43 checks pass and 19 prior source/rule files are unchanged. The [recipe index](DescentReviewChanges/ReviewBible/docs/mechanics/CRAFTING_RECIPE_REVIEW_INDEX.md) now records **90 of 687 recipes reviewed; 597 remain**. Cooking’s 44 source recipes are prepared for the next conference. No deletion, GitHub push or cosmology review occurred.'
    new='The latest recipe work completes [all 44 Cooking formulas](DescentReviewChanges/ReviewBible/docs/mechanics/COOKING_RECIPE_PLAYTEST.md), including [30 public cards](DescentReviewChanges/ReviewBible/docs/mechanics/COOKING_PUBLIC_RECIPE_CARDS.md). GPT’s five exact repairs are applied; 45 checks pass and 24 prior source/rule files are unchanged. The [recipe index](DescentReviewChanges/ReviewBible/docs/mechanics/CRAFTING_RECIPE_REVIEW_INDEX.md) records **134 of 687 recipe effects reviewed; 553 remain** (86 of 433 public formulas reviewed). The next [Poisoncrafting source preparation](docs/audit/2026-10-08/full-game/POISONCRAFTING_NEXT_REVIEW_NOTES.md) preserves 41 formulas and 25 exact public-book bindings; it is not yet approved. Generated bestiary discrepancies remain recorded for correction. No deletion, GitHub push or cosmology review occurred.\n\nThe preceding [45 Herbalism formulas](DescentReviewChanges/ReviewBible/docs/mechanics/HERBALISM_RECIPE_PLAYTEST.md), including 29 public cards, remain reviewed after four repairs and 43 checks.'
    assert old in s;s=s.replace(old,new,1)
    s=s.replace('Alchemy and Herbalism now account for 90 reviewed effects; the remaining 597 stay in the recipe queue.','Alchemy, Herbalism and Cooking now account for 134 reviewed effects; the remaining 553 stay in the recipe queue.')
    start.write_text(s,encoding='utf-8')
    review=AUDIT/'REVIEW_STATUS.md';backup(review,'REVIEW_STATUS_BEFORE_COOKING.md')
    with review.open('a',encoding='utf-8') as f:f.write('\n\n## All 44 Cooking recipe effects reviewed\n\nThe [actual exact GPT review](GPT_COOKING_EXACT_REVIEW.md) approves all 44 cards after five finite repairs, all applied: deterministic food incorporation, exact borrowed-speed composition, damage-preserving crock durability, predeclared maximum output dispositions and recipe-120 source/overlay labeling. All 45 checks pass; 24 protected source/prior-rule files are unchanged. Visibility remains 30 public / 2 restricted / 12 Director-only. [Final manifest](../../../../DescentReviewChanges/ReviewBible/docs/mechanics/COOKING_REVIEW_STATUS.json).\n\nCurrent recipe totals are **134 reviewed / 553 remaining**, with 86 of 433 public formulas reviewed. Earlier counts are historical checkpoints. The [next Poisoncrafting source audit](POISONCRAFTING_NEXT_REVIEW_NOTES.md) preserves 41 formulas and 25 exact public-book bindings without approving them. The [bestiary dependency discrepancy](COOKING_BESTIARY_DEPENDENCY_AUDIT.json) remains open in creature/encounter/companion coverage. Full game flow, ingredient access, balance and runtime remain unfinished. No original deletion, GitHub push or cosmology review.\n')
    (AUDIT/'COOKING_REVIEW_CHECKPOINT.md').write_text('# Cooking completed\n\nAll 44 formulas are jointly reviewed after five exact repairs. Thirty public cards, two restricted and twelve Director-only formulas retain their source boundaries. Five final artifacts are hashed. Forty-five source/projection checks pass and 24 protected files are unchanged. No original source information was deleted.\n\nCurrent recipe progress: 134 of 687 reviewed, 553 remaining; public progress 86 of 433. Next is Poisoncrafting 41 (25 public, three restricted, 13 Director-only), preserved in POISONCRAFTING_SOURCE_PREPARATION.json with exact public book bindings. Read POISONCRAFTING_NEXT_REVIEW_NOTES.md before its source conference. Broader spells, feats, expedition/Haven, bestiary corrections and companion integration remain open. No GitHub push yet. Careful cosmology review starts only after authorized push succeeds and the remote commit is verified.\n',encoding='utf-8')
    print(json.dumps({'status':label,'recipes':44,'reviewedTotal':134,'remaining':553,'checks':45}))
